{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1766213,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"purple-dark_un","paid":0,"title":"Perplexity","festival_id":521731,"organization_id":946,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-09T14:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/perplexity-nit-durgapur-1766213","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>PERPLEXITY - Where Strategy Meets Intuition<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Think you&rsquo;re good at making decisions under pressure? Can you stay one step ahead when the outcome depends on your next move?<\/p>\n<p><strong>Perplexity<\/strong> is a fast-paced and engaging competition by <strong>Team Aavishkar<\/strong>, designed to challenge your <strong>thinking, awareness, decision-making, and strategic skills<\/strong>. With every question and every choice, you&rsquo;ll have the opportunity to change the course of the game.<\/p>\n<p>Expect a mix of <strong>interesting questions, unexpected challenges, and strategic decisions<\/strong> that will keep you engaged throughout the competition. You don&rsquo;t need to be a technical expert or a quiz champion - all you need is <strong>curiosity, confidence, and a willingness to think differently<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Why You Should Participate<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Challenge yourself beyond the classroom<\/li>\n<li>Test your quick thinking and decision-making<\/li>\n<li>Put your strategy and knowledge to the test<\/li>\n<li>Compete with fellow students and aim for exciting rewards<\/li>\n<li>Gain a fun and competitive experience while showcasing your skills<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you&rsquo;re someone who loves quizzes, enjoys solving problems, or simply wants to try something new, <strong>Perplexity is your chance to step up and challenge yourself.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Bring your curiosity. Trust your instincts. Make your move.<\/p>\n<p><strong>The game is yours to shape. Are you ready?<\/strong><\/p>","overall_pri